{
 "description": "Requires a ChainHelix API key as bearer token, or 2 cents per call paid over Binance b402 in USDT, USDC, USD1 or U on BNB Smart Chain, or over x402 in USDC on the Base network. Lending liquidations per chain, protocol and direction over a window: event count, distinct borrowers and liquidators, and per token the amount liquidated (debt covered and collateral seized) with its USD value where the price is certain (USD stablecoins at $1, wrapped ETH, BTC, BNB, AVAX and POL at the latest hourly close; other tokens amount only, counted in unpricedLegs). Compound v2 and Venus events carry no token addresses and give counts only. window in hours, default 24, max 720; each hour is published about 90 minutes after it ends. Omit chain for all Chains covered: ethereum, bnb, avalanche, polygon.",
